    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I hear you, but \"completely insulated\" sounds like a very strong claim for a biotech/tech stock in this climate. If the regulators actually do drop that fine, isn't there going to be some price action regardless of what the algorithms do? I'm just trying to understand—is the system telling you the news actually hasn't happened yet, or are you saying the news won't affect our specific position at all?",
